        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>for completness Nature Guy might also want&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Power - materials - plant</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Principal - principal of flora</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Even if you don't have Minion Maker Archtype you can still get lots of use out of animal control. Natatively you have a pack of wolves as an escort but you have to act on your turn with nature control to have them attack/defend/boost/hinder/overcome for you. They would not be active targets on the feild but a clever enemy could roll to create a \"scattered pack\" persistant hinder on you to lower your rolls when using your beasts</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Duplication Self control power can also be used with out minion maker in this way. Multi Man from Hana Barbera's Imposibles/Super Globtroters was like this- he created copys of himself in collums and rows but they were not independant targets it was almost more like stretching or momentum powers sometimes&nbsp;</p>",
